---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Face from '../components/Face.astro';
---
<Base>
  <main>
    <Face class="face" />
    <p class="lead">Hola, I'm Otto, a designer and creative director in Buenos Aires, Argentina. I run <a href="https://otrostudio.co">Otro</a>, a product studio that helps teams figure out what to build.</p>
    <p>Before Otro I was Head of Design at DEPT®, where I built the Latin America team from one designer to thirty.</p>
    <p>I dig into problems before solving them, because understanding what's actually going on is what makes the answer feel obvious later.</p>
    <p>I've been living on the internet since I was making forum signatures with a cracked Photoshop in Necochea. When I'm not working I <span class="w">run</span>, go see <span class="w">live music</span>, take <span class="w">photos</span>, and <span class="w">screenshot</span> more things than I'll ever look at again.</p>
    <p>Whether you're building something or finding your way in design, I'm happy to help: <a href="mailto:christian@ottonello.co">christian@ottonello.co</a></p>
    <ul class="links">
      <li><a href="https://twitter.com/ottonello">Twitter</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/christianottonello">LinkedIn</a></li>
    </ul>
  </main>
</Base>
